2026-05-27 13:33:53 -04:00: **Fix:** Changed the import in `reconcile-runs.ts` from `'./dashboard-db'` → `'./dashboard-db.ts'`.
2026-05-27 13:33:53 -04:00: 
2026-05-27 13:33:53 -04:00: **Result:** Service ran successfully (`exit 0`), new bucket upserted at 17:33 UTC, `/api/health` now returns `ok: true`. The timer will continue writing buckets every 5 min normally.
