2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: | `/api/options-flow` | Firebase FlowGreeks (3 calls) | `8000ms` / `5000ms` |
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: | `/api/macro-regime` | Yahoo Finance VIX/yields/11 ETFs + CNN Fear&Greed | `6000ms` each |
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: | `/api/crypto` | Coinbase spot + stats | `6000ms` |
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: | `/api/live-strategy` | Alpaca paper API | `8000ms` |
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: | `/api/equity-intraday` | Alpaca portfolio history | `8000ms` |
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: 
2026-05-27 13:52:31 -04:00: All routes now fail fast and return partial/empty data instead of hanging indefinitely when upstreams are slow.
