2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: 
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: **Fix (3 changes in `src/app/api/macro-regime/route.ts`):**
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: - Added `timeoutSignal(ms)` helper using `AbortController` + `setTimeout` — bypasses Next.js fetch patching
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: - Replaced all `AbortSignal.timeout(3500)` calls with `timeoutSignal(2500)` + added `cache: 'no-store'` on all three fetch functions
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: - Tightened hard deadline: 8000ms → 7000ms (ensures response always beats the 10s audit limit)
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: 
2026-05-28 12:02:42 -04:00: **Result:** 200 in 0.6s, live data (VIX 15.96, RISK ON stance), `health ok: true`.
